IMAGINE/
├── streamlit_app.py          # Main frontend (this file)
├── requirements.txt          # Python dependencies
├── Dockerfile                # Containerisation (optional)
├── startup.sh                # Startup command for Azure
├── .streamlit/
│   └── secrets.toml          # (optional) for API keys
├── app/                      # FastAPI backend (if you generated it)
├── core/                     # Auth, users, roles, permissions, audit…
├── database/                 # Models, repositories, migrations
├── projects/                 # Projects, approvals, revisions…
├── bim/                      # Buildings, storeys, spaces, elements…
├── architecture/             # Generative design, zoning, site planning…
├── structural/               # Eurocode, beams, columns, slabs…
├── mep/                      # HVAC, electrical, plumbing
├── costing/                  # BOQ, quantity takeoff, forex…
├── construction/             # Planning, scheduling, RFIs…
├── documents/                # Drawing management, specs, contracts…
├── ai/                       # IMAGINE Architect, RAG, vector store…
├── analytics/                # Dashboards, KPIs, portfolio…
├── regional/                 # Uganda, Kenya, Tanzania…
├── integrations/             # Revit, AutoCAD, IFC, ArcGIS…
├── digital_twin/             # Assets, sensors, telemetry…
├── tests/                    # Unit, integration, API tests
├── deployment/               # Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions
└── docs/                     # Architecture, API, database docs



